      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">باعدهُ</span></b>  <i>He was,</i> or <i>became,</i> [<i>distant, remote,
far off,</i> or <i>aloof, from him;</i> or] <i>in a part, quarter,</i>
or <i>tract, different from that in which he</i> (the
other) <i>was.</i> (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جنب</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 4, in
seven places.

